WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:03.511
获取公开json源文件正文 / Fetch the public json source body

2
00:00:03.511 --> 00:00:16.651
选择源响应 / Select the source response

3
00:00:16.651 --> 00:00:20.915
由产品保存guide-request.json / Save guide-request.json through the product

4
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:23.886
核对实际保存的原始字节 / Verify the actually saved bytes

5
00:00:23.886 --> 00:00:26.863
获取公开binary源文件正文 / Fetch the public binary source body

6
00:00:26.863 --> 00:00:38.951
选择源响应 / Select the source response

7
00:00:38.951 --> 00:00:43.230
由产品保存guide-request.bin / Save guide-request.bin through the product

8
00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:46.200
核对实际保存的原始字节 / Verify the actually saved bytes

9
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.408
发送并选中Header-only等待项 / Send and select the Header-only pending request

10
00:00:49.408 --> 00:00:52.448
明确保持Body Off / Keep Body explicitly Off

11
00:00:52.448 --> 00:00:55.477
添加请求Header行 / Add a request Header row

12
00:00:55.477 --> 00:00:58.477
填写x-guide-request / Enter x-guide-request

13
00:00:58.477 --> 00:01:01.481
填写header-only / Enter header-only

14
00:01:01.481 --> 00:01:04.558
Forward edited后原正文不变 / Forward edited while retaining the original body

15
00:01:04.558 --> 00:01:07.719
发送空Text示例 / Send the empty-Text example

16
00:01:07.719 --> 00:01:10.774
选择Text但不填写替换 / Choose Text without entering a replacement

17
00:01:10.774 --> 00:01:13.838
核对HTTP头阶段空Text保持原正文 / Verify empty Text at the HTTP head stage retains the original body

18
00:01:13.838 --> 00:01:17.055
发送本次File等待请求 / Send the File replacement request

19
00:01:17.055 --> 00:01:27.088
选择File替换 / Choose File replacement

20
00:01:27.088 --> 00:01:31.388
选择刚保存的guide-request.json / Select the product-saved guide-request.json

21
00:01:31.388 --> 00:01:34.481
检查实际选择的文件 / Inspect the actually selected file

22
00:01:34.481 --> 00:01:37.549
核对源站收到完整文件字节 / Verify the origin received the complete file bytes

23
00:01:37.549 --> 00:01:40.723
发送本次File等待请求 / Send the File replacement request

24
00:01:40.723 --> 00:01:50.493
选择File替换 / Choose File replacement

25
00:01:50.493 --> 00:01:54.814
选择刚保存的guide-request.bin / Select the product-saved guide-request.bin

26
00:01:54.814 --> 00:01:57.846
检查实际选择的文件 / Inspect the actually selected file

27
00:01:57.846 --> 00:02:00.843
明确将Content-Type改为二进制 / Explicitly change Content-Type to binary

28
00:02:00.843 --> 00:02:03.932
核对源站收到完整文件字节 / Verify the origin received the complete file bytes

29
00:02:03.932 --> 00:02:07.060
返回同一规则 / Return to the same Rule

30
00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.459
切换到响应阶段 / Switch to the response phase

31
00:02:10.459 --> 00:02:13.522
Apply响应阶段 / Apply the response phase

32
00:02:13.522 --> 00:02:16.619
返回Capture / Return to Capture

33
00:02:16.619 --> 00:02:20.315
发送并等待源站响应头 / Send and wait for response headers

34
00:02:20.315 --> 00:02:23.962
将响应状态改为202 / Change response status to 202

35
00:02:23.962 --> 00:02:27.102
核对状态改变而响应正文保持 / Verify the status changes while the response body is retained

36
00:02:27.102 --> 00:02:30.190
返回规则收尾 / Return to the Rule for cleanup

37
00:02:30.190 --> 00:02:33.211
停用本轮规则 / Disable this Rule

38
00:02:33.211 --> 00:02:36.229
Apply停用状态 / Apply the disabled state
